## Save discipline
- Tee stdout: `... > results/diagnostics/<stem>_<UTCstamp>.log 2>&1`.
- A result is not "saved" until it has a scoreboard row, a `results/result_<NN>.json`, its basic figure,
  AND its reproducibility bundle in `results/snapshots/exp<NN>_<slug>/`.
- **Name every artifact by its experiment** (`exp<NN>_<slug>_*`) so figures, data, snapshots, and logs
  all trace to one experiment and its row in `results/INDEX.md`. No orphan files.
- Add the experiment's row to `results/INDEX.md` (the agent maintains it).
- Never delete data, figures, or snapshots without confirmation.
